; THE BEAST LORD'S PLATEAU (location.ashen.beast_lair) - the Fourth Flamebearer's ground.
;
; Modelled on scenes/regions/ember_crown/arena.tscn. The ramp arrives from the south at (0, 25); the
; challenge brazier stands at its head (0, 13) and the Lord rises at the plateau's centre, brazier +
; (0, 0, -13). THE FLOOR STAYS BARE: every prop is on the rim, beyond 16 m of the centre.
;
; WARNING THE SAME FOUR BINDINGS AS THE IRON KING'S ARENA ARE LOAD-BEARING:
;   Brazier/Summon      BossSummonComponent (enemy.beast_lord, flag.beast_lord_defeated, ungated)
;   AddSpawns/Spawn*    found by GROUP "boss_add_spawn"; the pack and the maws arrive there
;   BlightVents/Vent*   hidden lights the phase hooks reveal - the arena reports the phase
;   Phase2Hook/3Hook    ArenaHookComponent; resets on the boss's death, since the brazier re-arms
;                       until the defeat is persisted
